{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/127769-my-scion-character-sheets","id":127769,"title":"My Scion Character-Sheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-07T15:22:23-07:00","id":127769,"title":"My Scion Character-Sheets","content":"Since I have just finished the 3rd version of my character-sheet for Scion, I figured I should share it with you.<br /> <br /> Version 3 of the character-sheet for Scion has undergone several changes. Biggest change is that I've set the character-sheet up in layers, which makes it easier for me to alter the sheet later on. Other changes mostly involve layout, but I've also included a section for known languages. One of my personal favorite addition is that under each box of Epic Attribute is listed the bonus successes you get for that box. I've added something similar to the Legend rating, which lists the number of Legend points you get for that dot in Legend. I also added room for temporary Virtues, just in case it would come up, and a small section for languages, because, well you never know when it might be handy.<br /> <br /> The only problem I have is that I didn't have as much room for Boons and Knacks as I would have wanted. At the moment, you can write down a lot of information for each Boon and each Knack, at the expense of only fitting 7 of each per page. I'm considering ideas to fit more on each page, but without giving up too much of the writing space. My goal is 10 per page.<br /> <br /> What I plan on doing is to make pantheon sheets, expanded combat sheet, expanded Birthrights sheet (6 different Birthrights is just not enough) and Purview specific sheet, which will be ideal for Purviews that are associated with your divine parent or your pantheon.<br /> <br /> For now though, you can download the character-sheet from <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, and I would appreciate any comment you might have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T16:34:53-07:00","id":127816,"title":"","content":"It seems solid. Good job. My only concerns are: it references abilities and rules that do not exist in the most popular Scion Houserules, and it does not support more than six birthrights without reprinting page two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T01:51:57-07:00","id":128083,"title":"","content":"I agree with 6 Birthrights is just not enough. I am working on solutions. I also noticed late last night that I forgot to include space for DVs and Join Battle, so that needs to be fixed. Should have an update later today I hope, assuming I can keep myself awake.<br /> <br /> About the house-rule thing, its a character-sheet for Scion and not &quot;Scion according to Jim&quot;. I didn't even consider my own house-rules (I don't use ticks, so including Speed is unnecessary). If someone asks me to make a special character-sheet, I would be happy to oblige, but I think it is best to start with the basics and work from there. (Also, I admit I don't know what house-rules are the most popular, so I wouldn't know what to include :P )<br /> <br /> EDIT: The sheet has now been updated. It is now 5 pages long with a dedicated page to Birthrights (there is now room for 14 separate Birthrights).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","user":"Skari-dono","date":". 05-08-2014, 08:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T09:43:05-07:00","id":128321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Skari-dono</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/127769-my-scion-character-sheets?p=128083#post128083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About the house-rule thing, its a character-sheet for Scion and not &quot;Scion according to Jim&quot;. I didn't even consider my own house-rules (I don't use ticks, so including Speed is unnecessary). If someone asks me to make a special character-sheet, I would be happy to oblige, but I think it is best to start with the basics and work from there. (Also, I admit I don't know what house-rules are the most popular, so I wouldn't know what to include :P )</div> </div> </div> </div>The most popular are probably <a href=\"http://www.gothambynight.com/scion/\" target=\"_blank\">John's Scion Resource</a> and <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18IcvZDWbVVJ6yo58oY8zEYfAmOCMS1skw0saXzxgQQM\" target=\"_blank\">Scion 2.0</a>, though I think <a href=\"http://www.thecbg.org/wiki/index.php?title=Modern_Mythos\" target=\"_blank\">Modern Mythos</a> has some decent stuff as well. But I wasn't trying to suggest you include house rules on the sheet, just that there are rules written on the sheet that aren't universal to everyone's game. Thank you for the updates to the sheet!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T14:01:10-07:00","id":128504,"title":"","content":"I've been checking out John's Scion Resource for some time. I generally like the stuff there but some of it just doesn't make much sense to me or I think make the game just more complicated. I'm going to have a look at the other two <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I figured that a lot of players don't use many of the rules in Scion or have altered a lot of it. The Gods know that the game needs to be house-ruled. But I figured I should start with the standard rules and make alternatives from there. I'm sorry if my reply was harsh or rude, I got a lot less sleep than I wanted (joys of having a one year old child).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T02:55:54-07:00","id":129750,"title":"","content":"Made two little bonus sheets: Alternative Boons and Knacks pages that fit 12 of each without giving up too much of the room reserved for details. You can find both <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T03:31:14-07:00","id":129765,"title":"","content":"Advantages:<br /> - detailed, clean and sober.<br /> - very nice for physical characters<br /> - very instructive for players who are introduced to Scion.<br /> <br /> Disadvantages:<br /> - multiple sheets. I think it's somewhat confusing if you have to look at different sheets to know where you are going. It's a game and we want it as simple as possible.<br /> - too much information. I wouldn't like a sheet to be so informative. Players don't read, well, people don't read. They want us to tell them every information and repeat them until they remember it by heart.<br /> - two sheets should be the maximum sheets a player should handle. One with general knowledge about his character. The other one deals with more specific matter such as dice to roll when there's a battle. For long-term games, it might get useful especially the knacks' and boons' sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1837,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","user":"Wickedgrail","date":". 05-10-2014, 06:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T05:35:36-07:00","id":129816,"title":"","content":"I agree that five pages is a bit much, even the original version (before the update) with 4 pages was a bit much. This is, however, the number of pages I felt necessary for the system. I'll admit that the Attributes are taking more space than is necessary, and I don't need to include all that information about the character's visual appearance. However, this is the level of detail that I feel is required for my own players so that they do not need to spend as much time looking for the right book, looking for the right page, and then spend precious time reading through the advantages of the Boon/Knack/whatever before realizing it is not what they were looking for, and then repeat the process.<br /> <br /> The same is with weapons; they have four traits that you can easily jot down and keep handy, but as soon as someone else borrows it you have to read through notes and books to find the original bonuses. Movement is not simple either, and a lot of time goes into calculating how fast you can run, once every session that you decide you want to run. Figuring out how many bonus successes you get from Epic Attributes is not all that easy either, and a lot of time goes into figuring that out. What can you spend Legend on aside from Boons or Knacks? How do you regain Willpower? How many dice do I roll when I attack with my xiphos? These are the questions I get tired of answering after hearing them three or four times, especially when it is the same player who asks. That is why I make my character-sheet excessively detailed and long.<br /> <br /> But you're right, you should only need two pages. And I thank you for the reply because it did convince me that a condensed version is needed, so I will make one to the best of my ability. I've made a 2-page sheet for Scion before, so I should be able to do it again, but it won't have room for everything that I'd like to include, such as a detailed combat section.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T05:44:51-07:00","id":129820,"title":"","content":"Maybe all you need to do is to recreate a two-page character sheet and one more for a combat section. But one page only. In that case, the third page is optional and only fighters would need it and would find it very useful <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T06:22:08-07:00","id":129837,"title":"","content":"Why not both? I was thinking about expanding the combat section to a whole page (but including a Health section) and offer it up as a bonus for more combat focused characters. I could also make a lite-version of the character sheet that is only 2 pages, with Knacks and Boons on the flip side and a (lot) smaller section for Health. Simple as pie. Thanks for the idea <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (I have never made pie. I'm screwed.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T06:46:58-07:00","id":129854,"title":"","content":"(then, make a piece of cake)<br /> I'll be looking for your sheets <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T07:10:40-07:00","id":133673,"title":"","content":"Right, so that is done. You can download the 2 pages version from the website, on the <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Resources</a> page.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T07:40:56-07:00","id":139317,"title":"","content":"I've now finished the Expanded Combat sheet which holds more weapons, as well as more detailed information about those weapons, and more information about your Scion's combat abilities. In addition, the sheet has a bonus page with combat references, such as common actions and special attacks. It can be found directly <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Resources/Scion/Version%203/Scion%20v3%20-%20Expanded%20Combat%20-%20ES.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T01:21:34-07:00","id":145395,"title":"","content":"I've made a single page reference sheet for NPCs in Scion. You can find it <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Resources/Scion/Version%203/Scion%20v3%20-%20NPC%20-%20ES.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> (direct link) or at my <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Resources page</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T01:31:31-07:00","id":147732,"title":"","content":"Now up: 20 pages of All-Purpose Purviews; one page dedicated to each Purview published (including Ragnar\u00f6k and Yazata) and one page for your crazy experimentations. It can be found <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Resources/Scion/Version%203/Scion%20v3%20-%20APP%20-%20ES.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T07:53:12-07:00","id":151300,"title":"","content":"Those are all wonderful, Skari-dono. I especially love the Combat sheet! Thanks for making great things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2775-varygoode","name":"varygoode","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T17:21:29-07:00","id":207742,"title":"","content":"Wow, finally got something done. This is work in progress but someone asked for a crossover sheet for Scion/WoD. Since Hunter was mentioned in the discussion, I based it on Hunter: the Vigil. Some changes will be made soon, and the sheet will be updated, but you can find what's already done <a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/uploads/Resources/Scion/Version%203/Scion%20v3%20-%20WoD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T16:27:50-07:00","id":508540,"title":"","content":"Started working on a character-sheet for Scion again, since my group is getting back into the game soon. It is a 2-page landscape version, and although I call it v4 it is mostly just changes in layout and not really anything new. One new thing is that I posted a series of progress videos of me making the sheet in Adobe Illustrator. You can find more about this little project of mine on my website: <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Emerald Samurai</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T06:23:56-07:00","id":605535,"title":"","content":"Because time flies!<br /> <br /> Finished the v4 some months ago but that's not the good news! A third party asked MrGone to convert my version 3 character sheet for Scion into an interactive version, which you can now download from the <b><a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Resources</a></b> page of my website! Wheee! Check it out and don't forget to thank MrGone for the excellent work <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://emeraldsamurai.com\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai</a> for my alternative character-sheets for WoD, Scion, Exalted and more.<br /> Like my <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/EmeraldSamurai\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/308-skari-dono","name":"Skari-dono","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}